d rgb(203, 213, 225); background: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(15, 23, 42); min-width: 150px; cursor: pointer; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; width: 100%;"><span style="overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap;">All</span><span style="font-size: 0.8em; margin-left: 8px;">▼</span></div></div><div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.5rem; margin-top: 1rem;"><button style="padding: 0.4rem 0.8rem; background: rgb(37, 99, 235); color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: medium; border-radius: 4px; cursor: pointer; font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.85rem; width: 100%;">Select All</button><button style="padding: 0.4rem 0.8rem; background: rgb(220, 38, 38); color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: medium; border-radius: 4px; cursor: pointer; font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.85rem; width: 100%;">Clear Selection</button><label style="margin-top: 0.5rem; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 0.4rem; font-size: 0.8rem; color: rgb(100, 116, 139); cursor: pointer;"><input style="margin-top: 0.15rem;" type="checkbox" checked=""><span>Show theoretical heat pumps (1)<br><span style="font-size: 0.75rem;">Carnot and the best technology archetype, as reference points against the modelled machines.</span></span></label><label style="margin-top: 0.5rem; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 0.4rem; font-size: 0.8rem; color: rgb(100, 116, 139); cursor: pointer;"><input style="margin-top: 0.15rem;" type="checkbox"><span>Plot source-limited points (7)<br><span style="font-size: 0.75rem;">These cover only part of the demand above T_sink, so they lie off the sink profile.</span></span></label><label style="margin-top: 0.5rem; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 0.4rem; font-size: 0.8rem; color: rgb(100, 116, 139); cursor: pointer;"><input style="margin-top: 0.15rem;" type="checkbox"><span>Plot demand-limited points (23)<br><span style="font-size: 0.75rem;">These cover the full demand but leave waste heat unused at T_source, so they lie off the source profile.</span></span></label><p style="margin-top: 0.5rem; font-size: 0.8rem; color: rgb(100, 116, 139); text-align: center; font-weight: 500;">Feasible Combinations: 289<br><span style="font-weight: 400;">shown in chart: 232</span></p></div><div><label style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: rgb(100, 116, 139); display: block; margin-bottom: 0.25rem; font-weight: 500;">COP MODEL</label><select style="padding: 0.4rem; border-radius: 4px; border: 1px solid rgb(203, 213, 225); background: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(15, 23, 42); min-width: 150px;" title="2 temps: source return and sink supply. 4 temps: also source supply and sink return, both taken from the pinch (pinch − ΔTmin/2 and pinch + ΔTmin/2)."><option value="2t">Model 2 temps</option><option value="4t">Model 4 temps</option></select></div><div class="cf-trigger-block"><div class="cf-trigger-head"><label style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: rgb(100, 116, 139); display: block; margin-bottom: 0.25rem; font-weight: 500;">COP SOURCE</label><div class="chart-help-container inline"><button class="btn btn-sm chart-help-btn  " title="Show explanation"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-info" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 16v-4"></path><path d="M12 8h.01"></path></svg></button></div></div><button class="cf-trigger ">ƒ Use my own COP formula<span class="cf-trigger-sub">Paste a custom COP to perform integration and optimization with your own heat pump.</span></button></div></div><div class="pa-opt-chart" style="display: flex; min-width: 0px; overflow: hidden;"><div data-testid="chart">{"points":"232:a45f089d","maxQ":"Test@113","selected":["Butane_1@89.5","Butane_1@95.5"],"pinch":73,"mode":"net_load"}<button data-testid="chart-pick"></button></div></div></div></div></div><div class="cf-backdrop" role="presentation"><div class="cf-modal" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-label="Custom COP formula"><header class="cf-header"><h3>Custom COP formula</h3><button class="cf-close" aria-label="Close"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-x" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M18 6 6 18"></path><path d="m6 6 12 12"></path></svg></button></header><div class="cf-body"><label class="cf-label" for="cf-name">Name</label><input id="cf-name" class="cf-input" maxlength="60" placeholder="My heat pump" value="My heat pump"><label class="cf-label" for="cf-expr">COP =</label><textarea id="cf-expr" class="cf-expression " rows="14" spellcheck="false" maxlength="500" placeholder="0.5 * (T_sink + 273.15) / (T_sink - T_source)">0.5 * (T_sink + 273.15) / (T_sink - T_source)</textarea><div class="cf-verdict "><span class="cf-muted">checking…</span></div><div class="cf-probe"><label>Preview at source<input type="number" value="60"> °C</label><label>sink<input type="number" value="110"> °C</label></div><div class="cf-section-title">Variables — click to insert</div><div class="cf-chips"><button class="cf-chip" title="Conditional logic for intervals (formatted for readability)">Interval Example</button></div><div class="cf-section-title">cop_modal.built_in_title</div><div class="cf-chips"><button class="cf-chip cf-chip-example">Theoretical Carnot (50 %)</button><button class="cf-chip cf-chip-example">Stirling Engine</button><button class="cf-chip cf-chip-example">SHP (HFC/HFO)</button><button class="cf-chip cf-chip-example">SHP (R717)</button></div><button class="cf-disclosure"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg> Validity range<span class="cf-muted"> — where this heat pump may be used</span></button></div><footer class="cf-footer"><span class="cf-spacer"></span><button class="cf-btn">Cancel</button><button class="cf-btn cf-btn-primary" disabled="" title="Fix the formula first">Apply</button></footer></div></div></div>"`;

exports[`HPIOptimizationPanel > renders the same for every control > initial 1`] = `"<div class="analysis-panel " style="margin-top: 2rem;"><div class="pa-split-layout"><div class="pa-left-col"><div class="pa-hp-table-wrap" style="max-height: 440px; overflow-y: auto;"><div class="pa-hp-section-label" style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; position: sticky; top: 0px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); z-index: 2; margin: 0px; padding-bottom: 0.5rem; color: rgb(37, 99, 235); font-weight: 600;">Integration with Heat Pump model and optimization<span><div class="chart-help-container inline"><button class="btn btn-sm chart-help-btn  " title="Show explanation"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-info" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 16v-4"></path><path d="M12 8h.01"></path></svg></button></div></span></div><table class="pa-table pa-hp-table"><thead style="position: sticky; top: 30px; z-index: 2;"><tr><th style="cursor: pointer; user-select: none; position: sticky; top: 0px; z-index: 1; white-space: nowrap; min-width: 190px;"><div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.25rem;">TYPE<span><div class="chart-help-container inline"><button class="btn btn-sm chart-help-btn  " title="Show explanation"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-info" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 16v-4"></path><path d="M12 8h.01"></path></svg></button></div></span></div></th><th style="cursor: pointer; user-select: none; position: sticky; top: 0px; z-index: 1; white-space: nowrap; width: 1%;"><div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.25rem;">REFRIG.<span><div cl