_sink. The second figure is the full requirement; the rest still has to come from a utility.</p><p style="margin-top: 1rem; font-size: 0.85rem; color: rgb(100, 116, 139);">Click on any column header to sort. Click on any point in the chart to inspect its details and add it to the table.</p></div></div><div class="pa-right-col"><div class="pa-card pa-opt-row" style="gap: 1.5rem; align-items: flex-start;"><div class="pa-opt-filters" style="gap: 1rem; background: rgb(248, 250, 252); padding: 1rem; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(226, 232, 240);"><div><label style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: rgb(100, 116, 139); display: block; margin-bottom: 0.25rem; font-weight: 500;">MEDIUM SINK</label><select style="padding: 0.4rem; border-radius: 4px; border: 1px solid rgb(203, 213, 225); background: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(15, 23, 42); min-width: 150px; width: 100%;"><option value="All">All</option><option value="Custom">Custom</option><option value="Steam">Steam</option><option value="Water">Water</option><option value="—">—</option></select></div><div><label style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: rgb(100, 116, 139); display: block; margin-bottom: 0.25rem; font-weight: 500;">REFRIGERANT TYPE</label><select style="padding: 0.4rem; border-radius: 4px; border: 1px solid rgb(203, 213, 225); background: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(15, 23, 42); min-width: 150px; width: 100%;"><option value="All">All</option><option value="Custom formula">Custom formula</option><option value="Natural">Natural</option><option value="Synthetic">Synthetic</option><option value="Theoretical">Theoretical</option></select></div><div style="position: relative;"><label style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: rgb(100, 116, 139); display: block; margin-bottom: 0.25rem; font-weight: 500;">REFRIGERANT</label><div style="padding: 0.4rem; border-radius: 4px; border: 1px solid rgb(203, 213, 225); background: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(15, 23, 42); min-width: 150px; cursor: pointer; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; width: 100%;"><span style="overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap;">All</span><span style="font-size: 0.8em; margin-left: 8px;">▼</span></div></div><div style="position: relative;"><label style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: rgb(100, 116, 139); display: block; margin-bottom: 0.25rem; font-weight: 500;">NR. COMPRESSORS</label><div style="padding: 0.4rem; border-radius: 4px; border: 1px solid rgb(203, 213, 225); background: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(15, 23, 42); min-width: 150px; cursor: pointer; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; width: 100%;"><span style="overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap;">1</span><span style="font-size: 0.8em; margin-left: 8px;">▼</span></div><div style="position: absolute; top: 100%; left: 0px; margin-top: 4px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(203, 213, 225); border-radius: 4px; z-index: 10; width: 100%; padding: 0.5rem; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1); max-height: 200px; overflow-y: auto;"><label style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; padding: 0.25rem 0px; cursor: pointer; color: rgb(15, 23, 42);"><input type="checkbox">1</label><label style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; padding: 0.25rem 0px; cursor: pointer; color: rgb(15, 23, 42);"><input type="checkbox">2</label><label style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; padding: 0.25rem 0px; cursor: pointer; color: rgb(15, 23, 42);"><input type="checkbox">3</label><label style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; padding: 0.25rem 0px; cursor: pointer; color: rgb(15, 23, 42);"><input type="checkbox">—</label></div></div><div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.5rem; margin-top: 1rem;"><button style="padding: 0.4rem 0.8rem; background: rgb(37, 99, 235); color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: medium; border-radius: 4px; cursor: pointer; font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.85rem; width: 100%;">Select All</button><button style="padding: 0.4rem 0.8rem; background: rgb(220, 38, 38); color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: medium; border-radius: 4px; cursor: pointer; font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.85rem; width: 100%;">Clear Selection</button><label style="margin-top: 0.5rem; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 0.4rem; font-size: 0.8rem; color: rgb(100, 116, 139); cursor: pointer;"><input style="margin-top: 0.15rem;" type="checkbox" checked=""><span>Show theoretical heat pumps (1)<br><span style="font-size: 0.75rem;">Carnot and the best technology archetype, as reference points against the modelled machines.</span></span></label><label style="margin-top: 0.5rem; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 0.4rem; font-size: 0.8rem; color: rgb(100, 116, 139); cursor: pointer;"><input style="margin-top: 0.15rem;" type="checkbox"><span>Plot source-limited points (1)<br><span style="font-size: 0.75rem;">These cover only part of the demand above T_sink, so they lie off the sink profile.</span></span></label><label style="margin-top: 0.5rem; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 0.4rem; font-size: 0.8rem; color: rgb(100, 116, 139); cursor: pointer;"><input style="margin-top: 0.15rem;" type="checkbox"><span>Plot demand-limited points (19)<br><span style="font-size: 0.75rem;">These cover the full demand but leave waste heat unused at T_source, so they lie off the source profile.</span></span></label><p style="margin-top: 0.5rem; font-size: 0.8rem; color: rgb(100, 116, 139); text-align: center; font-weight: 500;">Feasible Combinations: 289<br><span style="font-weight: 400;">shown in chart: 111</span></p></div><div><label style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: rgb(100, 116, 139); display: block; margin-bottom: 0.25rem; font-weight: 500;">COP MODEL</label><select style="padding: 0.4rem; border-radius: 4px; border: 1px solid rgb(203, 213, 225); background: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(15, 23, 42); min-width: 150px;" title="2 temps: source return and sink supply. 4 temps: also source supply and sink return, both taken from the pinch (pinch − ΔTmin/2 and pinch + ΔTmin/2)."><option value="2t">Model 2 temps</option><option value="4t">Model 4 temps</option></select></div><div class="cf-trigger-block"><div class="cf-trigger-head"><label style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: rgb(100, 116, 139); display: block; margin-bottom: 0.25rem; font-weight: 500;">COP SOURCE</label><div class="chart-help-container inline"><button class="btn btn-sm chart-help-btn  " title="Show explanation"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-info" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 16v-4"></path><path d="M12 8h.01"></path></svg></button></div></div><button class="cf-trigger ">ƒ Use my own COP formula<span class="cf-trigger-sub">Paste a custom COP to perform integration and optimization with your own heat pump.</span></button></div></div><div class="pa-opt-chart" style="display: flex; min-width: 0px; overflow: hidden;"><div data-testid="chart">{"points":"111:81019e16","maxQ":"Test@113","selected":[],"pinch":73,"mode":"net_load"}<button data-testid="chart-pick"></button></div></div></div></div></div></div>"`;

exports[`HPIOptimizationPanel > renders the same for every control > optimization.panel.filters.refrigerant_closed 1`] = `"<div class="analysis-panel " style="margin-top: 2rem;"><div class="pa-split-layout"><div class="pa-left-col"><div class="pa-hp-table-wrap" style="max-height: 440px; overflow-y: auto;"><div class="pa-hp-section-label" style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; position: sticky; top: 0px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); z-index: 2; margin: 0px; padding-bottom: 0.5rem; color: rgb(37, 99, 235); font-weight: 600;">Integration with Heat Pump model and optimization<span><div class="chart-help-container inline"><button class="btn btn-sm chart-help-btn  " title="Show explanation"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-info" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 16v-4"></path><path d="M12 8h.01"></path></svg></button></div></span></div><table class="pa-table pa-hp-table"><thead style="position: sticky; top: 30px; z-index: 2;"><tr><th style="cursor: pointer; user-select: none; position: sticky; top: 0px; z-index: 1; white-space: nowrap; min-width: 190px;"><div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.25rem;">TYPE<span><div class="chart-help-container inline"><button class="btn btn-sm chart-help-btn  " title="Show explanation"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-info" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 16v-4"></path><path d="M12 8h.01"></path></svg></button></div></span></div></th><th style="cursor: pointer; user-select: none; position: sticky; top: 0px; z-index: 1; white-space: nowrap; width: 1%;"><div style="display: flex; align-items: cente